{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"thinking_end","contentIndex":0,"content":"Now I have a clear picture. Let me plan the migration.\n\nThe task says:\n1. Create `internal/handler/` package\n2. Migrate orchestration functions from `internal/cmd/{plan,doing,easy}.go` to handler\n3. handler signature receives flag values as params (Options{Verbose, DryRun, JobID}), NOT import `internal/cmd`\n4. Delete dead code `generateJobID()`\n5. cmd/{plan,doing,easy}.go become thin\n6. Rewrite tests that reference migrated functions (plan_test.go, doing_test.go, tools_test.go, dryrun_integration_test.go)\n7. `go build` + `go test ./internal/cmd/... ./internal/handler/... -timeout 60s -v` green\n\nThe migrated functions:\n- plan: `executePlanWorkflow`→`handler.Plan`, `reEnterPlanWorkflow`→`handler.ReEnterPlan`, `runPlanDryRun`→`handler.PlanDryRun`\n- doing: `executeDoingWorkflow`→`handler.Doing`, `runDoingDryRun`→`handler.DoingDryRun`, `loadTasksFromPlan`/`sortTaskFiles`/`extractTaskNumber`, `printExecutionSummary`, `commitDoingResults`/`ensureGitUserConfigured`/`ensureGitInitialized`\n- easy: `runEasyMode`→`handler.Easy`, `resumeEasyMode`→`handler.ResumeEasy`, `startEasySession`→`handler.StartEasySession`, `runEasyDryRun`→`handler.EasyDryRun`, `validateCtxInheritance`, `saveSessionID`/`loadSessionID`, `writeEasyTasksJSON`, `generateUUID`\n\nThe test6.py structural check requires:\n- internal/handler dir exists with non-test .go files\n- handler must NOT import `internal/cmd` (i.e. not `\"github.com/sunquan/rick/internal/cmd\"`)\n- handler defines 9 explicit functions: `Plan`, `ReEnterPlan`, `PlanDryRun`, `Doing`, `DoingDryRun`, `Easy`, `ResumeEasy`, `StartEasySession`, `EasyDryRun`\n\nNow, the module path. Let me check go.mod."}}
