`→`handler.EasyDryRun`, `validateCtxInheritance`, `saveSessionID`/`loadSessionID`, `writeEasyTasksJSON`, `generateUUID`\n\nThe test6.py structural check requires:\n- internal/handler dir exists with non-test .go files\n- handler must NOT import `internal/cmd` (i.e. not `\"github.com/sunquan/rick/internal/cmd\"`)\n- handler defines 9 explicit functions: `Plan`, `ReEnterPlan`, `PlanDryRun`, `Doing`, `DoingDryRun`, `Easy`, `ResumeEasy`, `StartEasySession`, `EasyDryRun`\n\nNow, the module path. Let me check go.mod.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_pfEjMMqnDrK6z4uo8Ngf6410","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/go.mod"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_9WWnSJHbjX4fhjrjpLgE2516","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick && git log --oneline -10 && echo \"---STATUS---\" && git status --short"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":2253,"output":609,"cacheRead":81280,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":485,"totalTokens":84142,"cost":{"input":0.000980055,"output":0.00052983,"cacheRead":0.00029464000000000004,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0018045250000000002}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786907090095,"responseId":"ce931f81-e2ba-4e09-8574-fbe0b973cc1d","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_pfEjMMqnDrK6z4uo8Ngf6410","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"module github.com/sunquan/rick\n\ngo 1.25.0\n\nrequire (\n\tgithub.com/spf13/cobra v1.10.2\n\tgithub.com/yuin/goldmark v1.7.16\n)\n\nrequire (\n\tgithub.com/inconshreveable/mousetrap v1.1.0 // indirect\n\tgithub.com/spf13/pflag v1.0.9 // indirect\n)\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786907097602},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_01_9WWnSJHbjX4fhjrjpLgE2516","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"d82fe83 chore(task3): mark task3 success in tasks.json\nd609565 feat(task3): 落地 env 模块（四职责：pi + 生态扩展 + rick 定制 + 